  message: "PR-ready. Per the user's design call, populated source-code Symbol.fingerprint via centralized helper rather than touching every analyzer. New hypergumbo_core/fingerprint.py with compute_symbol_fingerprint (Python ast + tree-sitter walk; comments filtered; dedent fallback for indented method snippets) plus a single orchestrator post-pass at cli.py:7286. Wire format declared via new schema.symbol_fingerprint_scheme = 'hypergumbo-symbol-fp-v1'. Self-analysis on packages/hypergumbo-tracker confirms 3072 methods + 568 classes + 430 functions + 122 variables + 80 files + 29 modules + 13 bash functions now carry structural fingerprints; external_symbol / call_site-with-span-0-0 / regex-only-analyzer symbols stay null. Existing manifest producers (toml-v1, json-v1, wgsl-v1) untouched via the 'skip if fingerprint is not None' guard. Awaits bakeoff validation of the broader-corpus claim: source-code Symbol fingerprint population goes from ~0% to a high percentage on hypergumbo's full self-analysis."  # ee9f
